2757
01:45:13,746 --> 01:45:15,346
(It's "Love Shot" of all songs?)

2758
01:45:15,346 --> 01:45:17,216
That is a signature for sure.

2759
01:45:17,486 --> 01:45:19,586
(Back Koo Young's signature song is "Love Shot" by EXO.)

2760
01:45:19,586 --> 01:45:21,116
(It recorded the highest number of views among EXO's videos...)

2761
01:45:21,116 --> 01:45:22,386
