2766
01:45:33,026 --> 01:45:35,196
I have a feeling people will go,

2767
01:45:35,196 --> 01:45:37,236
"Is he going to dance to "Love Shot" at his 60th birthday?"

2768
01:45:37,336 --> 01:45:40,806
I can never be separated from it.

2769
01:45:41,036 --> 01:45:42,376
No one will be able to come up...

2770
01:45:42,376 --> 01:45:44,246
