2774
01:45:50,946 --> 01:45:52,486
("Guilty" is an amazing one.)

2775
01:45:52,986 --> 01:45:54,116
(Groaning)

2776
01:45:54,116 --> 01:45:56,156
This is totally exciting.

2777
01:45:56,156 --> 01:45:57,256
(Fiddling while Rome burns)

2778
01:45:57,326 --> 01:46:01,426
(Kasper's signature song, "Guilty" by TAEMIN)

2779
01:46:01,556 --> 01:46:04,326
"Guilty" is the next one in line after "Love Shot..."

2780
01:46:04,466 --> 01:46:06,836
