2789
01:46:25,386 --> 01:46:27,086
I believe it's a true masterpiece.

2790
01:46:27,216 --> 01:46:30,386
I'm certain that there can't be anything better.

2791
01:46:30,886 --> 01:46:32,526
Sticky and sexy.

2792
01:46:32,786 --> 01:46:34,996
They're very sexy songs.

2793
01:46:35,296 --> 01:46:37,526
They're both at the top when it comes to male sexiness.

2794
01:46:37,766 --> 01:46:39,366
I won't lose when it comes to being sexy.

2795
01:46:39,796 --> 01:46:43,136
Koo Young is incredibly sexy.

2796
01:46:43,506 --> 01:46:45,666
A decadent and trapped sexiness.

2797
01:46:46,306 --> 01:46:48,836
Kasper can't be left out when it comes to adult sexiness.

2798
01:46:48,906 --> 01:46:52,076
He's great at expressing smooth and flowing...

2799
01:46:52,106 --> 01:46:53,946
