2804
01:47:03,086 --> 01:47:05,056
I came up with the choreography with him.

2805
01:47:05,056 --> 01:47:07,556
I know the song more than anyone else.

2806
01:47:07,726 --> 01:47:10,526
It won't make sense if I fail to pull this off.

2807
01:47:10,596 --> 01:47:12,726
"Love Shot" is about showing restraint charms,

2808
01:47:12,726 --> 01:47:15,396
