2810
01:47:18,136 --> 01:47:19,366
"Boom."

2811
01:47:19,366 --> 01:47:21,706
Spinning the gun based on the sound.

2812
01:47:21,706 --> 01:47:23,506
Reloading the gun with the click.

2813
