2863
01:49:41,446 --> 01:49:43,786
(What will Kasper's new "Love Shot" be like?)

2864
01:49:49,316 --> 01:49:50,356
Hold on.

2865
01:49:51,256 --> 01:49:53,756
The song and the choreography went well together.

2866
01:49:53,926 --> 01:49:56,226
The concept and image were a match.

2867
01:49:59,026 --> 01:50:00,696
(Gosh)

2868
01:50:00,936 --> 01:50:02,736
Why is he dancing while looking at the floor?

2869
01:50:03,466 --> 01:50:06,136
