2873
01:50:15,546 --> 01:50:17,746
I think he got intimidated by Koo Young's energy.

2874
01:50:19,716 --> 01:50:21,886
(His eyes are fixed on the ground for the whole time.)

2875
01:50:21,886 --> 01:50:23,656
(Feeling anxious)

2876
01:50:25,656 --> 01:50:26,896
Gosh, Kasper!

2877
01:50:27,096 --> 01:50:28,126
Really?

2878
01:50:28,796 --> 01:50:29,996
This is bad.

2879
01:50:30,026 --> 01:50:31,466
(Disappointed)

2880
01:50:31,496 --> 01:50:33,066
(He makes a mistake with the gun reloading move.)

2881
01:50:33,066 --> 01:50:34,596
(He messes up again.)

2882
01:50:34,936 --> 01:50:36,336
He's doomed.

2883
01:50:36,336 --> 01:50:38,866
I think he struggled to focus.

2884
01:50:41,506 --> 01:50:44,006
(Kasper's new "Love Shot" performance ends.)

2885
01:50:44,006 --> 01:50:45,406
(Checking the room)

2886
01:50:45,406 --> 01:50:47,246
