2892
01:50:59,026 --> 01:51:00,056
It was really disappointing.

2893
01:51:00,226 --> 01:51:03,096
He could've done better. He's much better than that.

2894
01:51:03,456 --> 01:51:05,826
As someone who was excited to see his performance,

2895
01:51:06,566 --> 01:51:07,736
