2899
01:51:17,746 --> 01:51:19,876
"It's tough to beat the original."

2900
01:51:20,046 --> 01:51:21,916
"It isn't that different from the original choreography."

2901
01:51:22,416 --> 01:51:25,686
"It's like a mix of Verse 1 and Verse 3."

2902
01:51:26,046 --> 01:51:28,056
