They're both monsters.

3171
02:02:28,616 --> 02:02:30,546
The strength of Hash's new "Iron..."

3172
02:02:30,676 --> 02:02:32,286
was that the build-up was really good.

3173
02:02:32,646 --> 02:02:36,386
There was a complete structure in this short song.

3174
02:02:36,486 --> 02:02:38,686
As for JEONG MIN JUN's "Dream State,"

3175
02:02:38,956 --> 02:02:41,226
the way he used his eyes...

3176
02:02:41,356 --> 02:02:43,956
helped me follow the flow,

3177
02:02:44,096 --> 02:02:45,696
and it led me throughout the song.

3178
02:02:45,696 --> 02:02:47,326
I was completely focused.

3179
02:02:47,696 --> 02:02:49,736
But if I am to point out a negative,

3180
02:02:50,066 --> 02:02:52,136
it felt like MIN JUN would be the only one who could...

3181
02:02:52,336 --> 02:02:53,436
pull the moves.

3182
02:02:54,006 --> 02:02:56,276
"Will the other dancers be able to pull off those moves?"

3183
02:02:56,676 --> 02:02:59,676
"Will he be able to direct those moves well?"

3184
02:03:00,006 --> 02:03:01,616
I was filled with those worries.

3185
02:03:02,916 --> 02:03:03,976
I'm going to win.

3186
02:03:04,746 --> 02:03:06,546
Choreographer JEONG MIN JUN's "Iron."

3187
02:03:06,846 --> 02:03:08,916
Choreographer Hash's "Dream State."

3188
02:03:09,686 --> 02:03:12,886
Who will protect their signature and who will take away a signature?

3189
02:03:12,956 --> 02:03:15,126
Hash's structure...

3190
02:03:15,326 --> 02:03:17,966
and engagement was really impressive.

3191
02:03:18,196 --> 02:03:20,026
I think the public will really like it.

3192
02:03:20,326 --> 02:03:22,036
There will be many female fans.

3193
02:03:22,236 --> 02:03:23,596
It's a tight match.

3194
02:03:23,596 --> 02:03:26,036
It feels different than the live performance.

3195
02:03:27,366 --> 02:03:28,376
I love Hash.

3196
02:03:28,376 --> 02:03:31,706
The signature choreography results of the Public Judge...

3197
02:03:32,006 --> 02:03:33,906
will be revealed now.

3198
02:03:34,446 --> 02:03:36,616
(Who did the Public Judge choose between JEONG MIN JUN and Hash?)

3199
02:03:37,886 --> 02:03:39,046
(JEONG MIN JUN wins with the Public Judge evaluation.)

3200
02:03:39,386 --> 02:03:40,386
(Impressed)

3201
02:03:41,916 --> 02:03:43,086
Gosh.

3202
02:03:43,956 --> 02:03:45,756
I felt hope after winning the vote.

3203
02:03:45,886 --> 02:03:47,356
Gosh, I'm in trouble.

3204
02:03:47,356 --> 02:03:49,826
I believe the other choreographers will choose me.

3205
02:03:49,996 --> 02:03:53,826
Which signature choreography did the seven choreographers choose?

3206
02:03:54,366 --> 02:03:56,466
I believe they have voted for me.

3207
02:03:56,466 --> 02:03:58,366
I want to place a bet on my win.

3208
02:03:58,366 --> 02:04:00,666
The final result will be revealed.

3209
02:04:01,006 --> 02:04:02,176
(NaiN: JEONG MIN JUN, Renan: JEONG MIN JUN,)

3210
02:04:03,606 --> 02:04:04,946
(BADA: JEONG MIN JUN, Back Koo Young: JEONG MIN JUN,)

3211
02:04:04,946 --> 02:04:06,776
(BABYZOO: JEONG MIN JUN, Simeez: JEONG MIN JUN,)

3212
02:04:06,776 --> 02:04:09,016
(INGYOO: JEONG MIN JUN, Kasper: Hash)

3213
02:04:09,016 --> 02:04:10,216
It's 8 to 1.

3214
02:04:11,046 --> 02:04:12,246
Oh, no.

3215
02:04:12,916 --> 02:04:14,246
Look at Hash's face.

3216
02:04:15,156 --> 02:04:16,986
I got shocked. "I lost."

3217
02:04:17,216 --> 02:04:19,586
I hoped that I wasn't the one with one vote.

3218
02:04:19,986 --> 02:04:21,726
But it ended up being me.

3219
02:04:22,896 --> 02:04:24,866
JEONG MIN JUN takes the win.

3220
02:04:27,466 --> 02:04:28,896
I was able to prove myself.

3221
02:04:28,896 --> 02:04:30,036
I felt delighted.

3222
02:04:30,036 --> 02:04:32,036
Through MIN JUN's "Dream State,"

3223
02:04:32,036 --> 02:04:34,306
the emotions were expressed really well.

3224
02:04:34,306 --> 02:04:35,706
The energy never died down.

3225
02:04:35,836 --> 02:04:37,946
I was envious of that spirit.

3226
02:04:38,076 --> 02:04:40,346
There were so many parts that amazed me.

3227
02:04:40,346 --> 02:04:42,276
The whole performance was so entertaining.

3228
02:04:42,276 --> 02:04:43,946
The hype of the build-up that was set up...

3229
02:04:43,946 --> 02:04:45,186
was really high.

3230
02:04:45,186 --> 02:04:48,056
It made me forget Hash's signature moves for a second.

3231
02:04:48,056 --> 02:04:49,586
That was how good it was.

3232
02:04:49,786 --> 02:04:51,226
"This guy deserves to be in..."

3233
02:04:51,226 --> 02:04:52,226
"Street World Fighter: Directors' War."

3234
02:04:52,326 --> 02:04:55,096
I believe the other choreographers predicted my elimination...

3235
02:04:55,096 --> 02:04:58,266
because they didn't know much about me.

3236
02:04:58,626 --> 02:05:01,936
I think I was able to show everyone how I dance,

3237
02:05:02,066 --> 02:05:03,666
and I feel delighted.

3238
02:05:04,336 --> 02:05:05,966
You thought I was going to go home early, right?

3239
02:05:06,206 --> 02:05:07,466
Things have just started for me.

3240
02:05:08,276 --> 02:05:09,276
She's mad.

3241
02:05:09,276 --> 02:05:11,376
- It must be a great shock for her. - Right.

3242
02:05:11,746 --> 02:05:15,246
Hash underestimated MIN JUN...

3243
02:05:15,246 --> 02:05:16,676
and got humiliated.

3244
02:05:17,886 --> 02:05:20,486
Do I see things differently?

3245
02:05:21,156 --> 02:05:22,556
Hash's performance...

3246
02:05:22,756 --> 02:05:25,256
was touching.

3247
02:05:25,626 --> 02:05:27,026
I enjoyed her performance the most.

3248
02:05:27,186 --> 02:05:29,826
There was a big title left as director.

3249
02:05:30,196 --> 02:05:32,326
I had to get that title no matter what.

3250
02:05:32,666 --> 02:05:35,296
To prevent from losing,

3251
02:05:35,296 --> 02:05:37,296
I will take out my whole brain.

3252
02:05:39,666 --> 02:05:41,276
(Brain removal performance)

3253
02:05:41,276 --> 02:05:43,336
- That's the scariest thing. - That's the scariest thing.

3254
02:05:43,336 --> 02:05:44,676
(Gosh!)

3255
02:05:44,676 --> 02:05:45,676
That's so scary!

3256
02:05:46,276 --> 02:05:47,746
Nothing can be scarier than that.

3257
02:05:48,246 --> 02:05:49,616
She's going to take out her brain.

3258
02:05:49,946 --> 02:05:51,216
I will grind my teeth.

3259
02:05:51,216 --> 02:05:53,086
I will open up my whole brain...

3260
02:05:53,086 --> 02:05:55,256
so that MIN JUN can't win.

3261
02:05:55,256 --> 02:05:59,156
I will show you how great my directing is.

3262
02:05:59,226 --> 02:06:01,726
Hash will really grind her teeth.

3263
02:06:02,226 --> 02:06:03,296
That worried me.

3264
02:06:03,296 --> 02:06:05,426
I know what happens when Hash takes out her brain.

3265
02:06:05,696 --> 02:06:08,366
She's exceptional when it comes to making performances.

3266
02:06:08,366 --> 02:06:09,566
I must be fully prepared.

3267
02:06:10,066 --> 02:06:12,536
We'll have to see how things go for the directing as well.

3268
02:06:12,606 --> 02:06:14,836
It will be clearer...

3269
02:06:15,276 --> 02:06:17,036
with who will end up going home.

3270
02:06:17,636 --> 02:06:19,946
The last group of the signature choreography match.

3271
02:06:19,946 --> 02:06:22,076
- The last one is the best one. - I got so excited.

3272
02:06:22,076 --> 02:06:23,376
This is going to be so entertaining.

3273
02:06:23,576 --> 02:06:24,946
BADA versus INGYOO.

3274
02:06:25,816 --> 02:06:26,816
This is going to be fun to watch!

3275
02:06:26,816 --> 02:06:28,416
This is another bloody battle.

3276
02:06:28,416 --> 02:06:30,616
I think BEBE is the best female crew...

3277
02:06:30,616 --> 02:06:32,356
and WE DEM BOYZ is the best male crew.

3278
02:06:32,356 --> 02:06:34,026
I can't imagine who will win...

3279
02:06:34,026 --> 02:06:35,596
when two people at the top go against each other.

3280
02:06:35,596 --> 02:06:37,296
(Who will win this massive battle?)

3281
02:06:37,296 --> 02:06:38,926
Will the signature be taken away...

3282
02:06:39,126 --> 02:06:40,696
or will it be protected until the end?

3283
02:06:40,826 --> 02:06:43,836
What are the signatures of these two?

3284
02:06:44,196 --> 02:06:47,006
BADA's signature choreography that INGYOO must take away...

3285
02:06:47,006 --> 02:06:48,606
- Could it be "Smoke?" - is "Smoke."

3286
02:06:48,776 --> 02:06:49,806
I was right!

3287
02:06:49,806 --> 02:06:50,836
(I totally approve that one.)

3288
02:06:51,076 --> 02:06:52,106
Gosh.

3289
02:06:53,306 --> 02:06:55,546
(Everyone automatically does the lighter move.)

3290
02:06:55,546 --> 02:06:57,016
("Smoke" by Dynamic Duo and Lee Young Ji...)

3291
02:06:57,016 --> 02:06:58,686
(started a global challenge syndrome in 2023.)

3292
02:06:58,686 --> 02:07:01,156
I came up with the choreography from start to finish.

3293
02:07:01,156 --> 02:07:03,586
The whole country copied...

3294
02:07:03,586 --> 02:07:06,386
the intense highlight.

3295
02:07:06,386 --> 02:07:08,426
Everyone turned on the lighter with their fingers...

3296
02:07:08,526 --> 02:07:09,526
three years ago.

3297
02:07:10,156 --> 02:07:13,696
The lyrics, energy, and choreography of the song.

3298
02:07:13,696 --> 02:07:17,396
"Smoke" shines bright when these three things work together.

3299
02:07:17,736 --> 02:07:19,566
Will he be able to take that away?

3300
02:07:19,706 --> 02:07:21,606
My signature will also hard to take away.

3301
02:07:21,806 --> 02:07:23,236
(This is it.)

3302
02:07:24,036 --> 02:07:25,306
INGYOO's signature choreography...

3303
02:07:25,306 --> 02:07:28,176
that BADA must take away is "like JENNIE."

3304
02:07:28,176 --> 02:07:29,676
("like JENNIE" by Jennie was a huge hit in 2025.)

3305
02:07:29,846 --> 02:07:31,646
(The official music video got more than 270 million views.)

3306
02:07:31,946 --> 02:07:34,016
The catchy moves...

3307
02:07:34,216 --> 02:07:35,886
make you want to copy them.

3308
02:07:36,016 --> 02:07:38,156
I believe that song had the most challenges.

3309
02:07:38,226 --> 02:07:39,226
I even did one.

3310
02:07:39,226 --> 02:07:41,196
(Even Back Koo Young wanted to cover "like JENNIE.")

3311
02:07:41,196 --> 02:07:43,226
It took us a while to find something...

3312
02:07:43,226 --> 02:07:44,596
for the "ooh" at the start of the chorus.

3313
02:07:44,666 --> 02:07:47,066
There weren't many moves that went well with that.

3314
02:07:47,126 --> 02:07:48,696
I believe it will be tough to take away this song.

3315
02:07:49,236 --> 02:07:50,596
"Smoke" and "like JENNIE?"

3316
02:07:50,596 --> 02:07:51,706
It's a dizzying battle.

3317
02:07:51,706 --> 02:07:53,866
I would've wanted to give up.

3318
02:07:54,006 --> 02:07:56,576
I think it will be equally frustrating for them.

3319
02:07:56,636 --> 02:07:59,006
Will INGYOO be able to make the same impact...

3320
02:07:59,006 --> 02:08:00,276
as BADA?

3321
02:08:00,276 --> 02:08:01,616
On the other hand,

3322
02:08:01,616 --> 02:08:03,146
how will BADA overcome "like JENNIE?"

3323
02:08:03,576 --> 02:08:04,816
(Around 18 minutes have passed for the choreography creation.)

3324
02:08:04,816 --> 02:08:06,746
Gosh, I'm all wet.

3325
02:08:07,216 --> 02:08:09,386
(BADA is sweating buckets already.)

3326
02:08:09,386 --> 02:08:10,856
(She blocks her sweat glands with tissue paper...)

3327
02:08:10,856 --> 02:08:12,326
(and focuses on creating the choreography.)

3328
02:08:12,556 --> 02:08:14,326
I wasn't able to eat.

3329
02:08:14,926 --> 02:08:16,826
"Let's try every move while I can."

3330
02:08:16,826 --> 02:08:18,966
My mind was filled with this thought.

3331
02:08:23,696 --> 02:08:24,836
I can't think.

3332
02:08:25,566 --> 02:08:28,176
(She falls to the ground in the end.)

3333
02:08:28,706 --> 02:08:29,806
Think.

3334
02:08:31,206 --> 02:08:32,276
Think.

3335
02:08:34,046 --> 02:08:36,246
This mission was tough.

3336
02:08:36,446 --> 02:08:39,346
It was a huge mission even though it was the first one.

3337
02:08:39,646 --> 02:08:41,316
Could there be a bigger mission than this?

3338
02:08:43,256 --> 02:08:45,556
I'm desperate right now.

3339
02:08:45,986 --> 02:08:49,396
Instead of taking away "like JENNIE" in this mission,

3340
02:08:49,396 --> 02:08:51,126
protecting "Smoke..."

3341
02:08:51,266 --> 02:08:53,426
is much more important to me.

3342
02:08:54,066 --> 02:08:55,566
BADA is the only one...

3343
02:08:55,566 --> 02:08:57,666
who is a player and choreographer at the same time.

3344
02:08:57,666 --> 02:08:59,536
It wasn't created for someone else.

3345
02:08:59,536 --> 02:09:01,236
The choreography is an expression of herself.

3346
02:09:01,236 --> 02:09:03,636
That's a true signature.

3347
02:09:04,036 --> 02:09:05,646
"Smoke..."

3348
02:09:05,646 --> 02:09:08,146
isn't a performance of another artist.

3349
02:09:08,716 --> 02:09:10,376
The star of this choreography is me.

3350
02:09:10,776 --> 02:09:13,786
It holds a significant meaning to me.

3351
02:09:14,656 --> 02:09:16,716
The choreography wasn't chosen easily.

3352
02:09:16,716 --> 02:09:18,926
It was chosen after going through many difficulties...

3353
02:09:18,926 --> 02:09:21,396
and it received a lot of love.

3354
02:09:21,496 --> 02:09:22,796
It was recognized by others.

3355
02:09:23,326 --> 02:09:26,366
It became the foundation of my career as a dancer.

3356
02:09:26,526 --> 02:09:27,596
I became one...

3357
02:09:27,596 --> 02:09:31,866
with the song, lyrics, and choreography...

3358
02:09:33,366 --> 02:09:35,176
It feels like I'm the singer of this song.

3359
02:09:35,336 --> 02:09:37,836
That's how connected I am with this song.

3360
02:09:39,146 --> 02:09:40,646
It's a piece...

3361
02:09:40,646 --> 02:09:42,716
that can't be separated from her.

3362
02:09:42,916 --> 02:09:44,616
But that gets torn away from her?

3363
02:09:44,716 --> 02:09:46,246
That will break her heart.

3364
02:09:46,616 --> 02:09:49,186
You won't be able to imagine what it will feel like.

3365
02:09:49,386 --> 02:09:51,956
It will feel like having to abandon myself.

3366
02:09:52,986 --> 02:09:54,026
Please.

3367
02:09:54,286 --> 02:09:56,756
I must get chosen.

3368
02:09:57,256 --> 02:10:00,066
If I start with a loss,

3369
02:10:00,526 --> 02:10:04,536
I don't know what I can show through this mission.

3370
02:10:05,706 --> 02:10:07,366
The evaluation video was shown earlier.

3371
02:10:07,436 --> 02:10:09,676
It feels like everything mentioned is becoming true.

3372
02:10:09,836 --> 02:10:11,846
She's a true legend as a player,

3373
02:10:12,046 --> 02:10:14,446
but this isn't "Street Woman Fighter."

3374
02:10:14,716 --> 02:10:17,476
BADA is a choreographer, not a director.

3375
02:10:17,676 --> 02:10:20,386
I wasn't acknowledged as a director.

3376
02:10:20,516 --> 02:10:23,056
If this mission goes wrong,

3377
02:10:23,186 --> 02:10:27,626
I will lose everyone's trust one more time.

3378
02:10:28,726 --> 02:10:32,766
That means I must never get my song taken away.

3379
02:10:32,996 --> 02:10:35,136
I will do anything I can...

3380
02:10:35,536 --> 02:10:38,036
to take away "like JENNIE."

3381
02:10:39,306 --> 02:10:40,936
BADA didn't stop...

3382
02:10:40,936 --> 02:10:43,036
and kept trying to create something.

3383
02:10:43,606 --> 02:10:46,106
She crushed her whole body for this.

3384
02:10:47,446 --> 02:10:49,616
I thought the floor was going to sink in.

3385
02:10:49,616 --> 02:10:51,146
She kept dancing with full power.

3386
02:10:51,346 --> 02:10:53,746
(INGYOO watches her through the mirror at that moment.)

3387
02:10:53,746 --> 02:10:55,016
I watched BADA,

3388
02:10:55,486 --> 02:10:57,256
and it felt like she was determined to win.

3389
02:10:57,486 --> 02:10:59,926
Her dancing skills are so persuasive.

3390
02:11:00,226 --> 02:11:01,226
I'm doomed.

3391
02:11:01,226 --> 02:11:04,056
I must be serious about this.

3392
02:11:04,596 --> 02:11:06,466
I kept watching him as well.

3393
02:11:06,466 --> 02:11:08,836
I watched him whenever he appeared.

3394
02:11:08,966 --> 02:11:11,236
"What did INGYOO come up with?"

3395
02:11:11,236 --> 02:11:12,436
I got curious about that.

3396
02:11:12,736 --> 02:11:15,006
I wonder what's inside his head...

3397
02:11:15,006 --> 02:11:16,806
for him to come up with things so easily.

3398
02:11:16,806 --> 02:11:18,706
What's inside INGYOO's head?

3399
02:11:18,846 --> 02:11:20,746
I was really curious about...

3400
02:11:20,746 --> 02:11:21,916
INGYOO's choreography.

3401
02:11:22,716 --> 02:11:24,916
I watched him while keeping him in check.

3402
02:11:26,616 --> 02:11:29,216
(Grunting)

3403
02:11:30,856 --> 02:11:32,356
He looked really free.

3404
02:11:32,526 --> 02:11:35,056
INGYOO's strategy is to become an insane person?

3405
02:11:37,296 --> 02:11:38,466
I got excited.

3406
02:11:38,896 --> 02:11:40,196
I tried to get possessed.

3407
02:11:40,526 --> 02:11:42,566
For a choreography to do well,

3408
02:11:42,566 --> 02:11:43,866
it has to be interesting.

3409
02:11:43,966 --> 02:11:45,106
Light it up!

3410
02:11:45,966 --> 02:11:47,106
Bang!

3411
02:11:47,266 --> 02:11:48,406
I don't think...

3412
02:11:48,406 --> 02:11:50,276
he's listening to "Smoke" right now.

3413
02:11:50,276 --> 02:11:52,146
That can't be for "Smoke."

3414
02:11:52,646 --> 02:11:53,876
(He's listening to "Smoke" to everyone's surprise.)

3415
02:11:53,876 --> 02:11:56,146
I can go with a different style.

3416
02:11:56,146 --> 02:11:57,276
It can be more exciting.

3417
02:11:57,276 --> 02:11:58,686
Slime style.

3418
02:11:59,046 --> 02:12:00,046
It can feel more relaxed.

3419
02:12:00,046 --> 02:12:01,456
Liquid monster style.

3420
02:12:01,716 --> 02:12:02,716
It can be fun.

3421
02:12:02,716 --> 02:12:04,156
Tube man style. Get what I'm saying?

3422
02:12:04,586 --> 02:12:05,786
That's my core.

3423
02:12:08,626 --> 02:12:10,456
Light it up. I should ignite it.

3424
02:12:11,256 --> 02:12:12,596
That lighter sound?

3425
02:12:12,766 --> 02:12:14,966
(The intro everyone knows)

3426
02:12:14,966 --> 02:12:16,766
I'll erase it from the start.

3427
02:12:16,966 --> 02:12:19,666
The word "Smoke" is also mentioned in the title.

3428
02:12:20,106 --> 02:12:22,476
