02:23:15,256 --> 02:23:16,356
(He's disrespecting me in front of my team.)

3689
02:23:16,356 --> 02:23:17,956
(I need to get revenge quickly...)

3690
02:23:17,956 --> 02:23:19,266
(by winning.)

3691
02:23:19,266 --> 02:23:23,666
(Learning "Armageddon" from another choreographer...)

3692
02:23:23,666 --> 02:23:25,096
(It's very stressful.)

3693
02:23:25,766 --> 02:23:28,806
(Only the loser feels that unique anger.)

3694
02:23:28,806 --> 02:23:30,606
(I will definitely win.)

3695
02:23:30,606 --> 02:23:32,146
(The full-scale Directors' War is...)

3696
02:23:32,146 --> 02:23:33,546
(starting now.)

3697
02:23:33,546 --> 02:23:34,606
(Do you want to do this 100 times?)

3698
02:23:34,606 --> 02:23:35,616
(Rina!)

3699
02:23:35,616 --> 02:23:37,116
(Rina, you need to practice more.)

3700
02:23:37,116 --> 02:23:38,886
(Not knowing the timing is a problem, but...)

3701
02:23:38,886 --> 02:23:40,486
(your attitude is also the problem right now.)

3702
02:23:40,486 --> 02:23:41,886
(Only one thing remains.)

3703
02:23:41,886 --> 02:23:44,116
(Final Director Credit battle)

3704
02:23:44,116 --> 02:23:45,186
(Last Run)

3705
02:23:45,186 --> 02:23:46,186
(Why are you stopping there?)
(There seems to be a problem.)

3706
02:23:47,186 --> 02:23:48,356
(At this rate, we might not rehearse.)

3707
02:23:49,026 --> 02:23:50,026
(You must go out as if your life depends on it.)

3708
02:23:50,026 --> 02:23:51,556
(There is no time, so we will move quickly.)

3709
02:23:51,556 --> 02:23:52,566
(This is not going to work.)

3710
02:23:52,566 --> 02:23:54,026
(Run, run, run.)

3711
02:23:55,536 --> 02:23:56,666
(Can I speak directly?)

3712
02:23:56,666 --> 02:24:00,266
(Dancers in the center seem to make mistakes often.)

3713
02:24:00,266 --> 02:24:01,666
(This is truly driving me crazy.)

3714
02:24:02,136 --> 02:24:03,176
(Oh no.)

3715
02:24:03,176 --> 02:24:05,576
(Dancer casting was very important.)

3716
02:24:05,576 --> 02:24:07,106
(We failed. That is right.)

3717
02:24:07,646 --> 02:24:09,476
(I cried hard earlier.)

3718
02:24:09,476 --> 02:24:11,976
(I want to do more, but I am worried.)

3719
02:24:12,746 --> 02:24:15,586
(Did I get too greedy?)

3720
02:24:15,586 --> 02:24:17,556
(Renan's team practice is sailing smoothly in a pleasant atmosphere.)

3721
02:24:17,856 --> 02:24:19,226
(Yes, yes.)

3722
02:24:19,526 --> 02:24:20,526
Okay.

3723
02:24:20,526 --> 02:24:22,086
(Dancers are also doing very well.)

3724
02:24:25,056 --> 02:24:26,196
(Dancer selection is also a director's ability.)

3725
02:24:26,196 --> 02:24:29,566
(I'm completely immersed in the dances I practiced hard.)

3726
02:24:29,566 --> 02:24:30,896
(I guess I did not work hard enough.)

3727
02:24:30,896 --> 02:24:32,906
(I should have worked harder.)

3728
02:24:32,906 --> 02:24:34,036
(It's been only 15 minutes.)

3729
02:24:34,036 --> 02:24:35,306
(I know, I know.)

3730
02:24:35,306 --> 02:24:37,576
(I'm so sorry to say this, but this is a survival show,)

3731
02:24:37,576 --> 02:24:39,006
(so I can't accommodate everyone.)

3732
02:24:40,246 --> 02:24:42,746
(You create your own dance style, but...)

3733
02:24:42,746 --> 02:24:45,216
(I think you need to look from other perspectives too.)

3734
02:24:45,216 --> 02:24:47,516
(I think they have some complaints to me.)

3735
02:24:48,716 --> 02:24:49,786
(It's insufficient.)

3736
02:24:50,956 --> 02:24:52,116
(Do you want to do this one 100 times?)

3737
02:24:52,986 --> 02:24:54,256
(Everyone is truly unbelievable.)

3738
02:24:54,956 --> 02:24:57,156
(I'm going crazy. I want to die.)

3739
02:24:57,156 --> 02:24:59,996
(Is it right for me to ask the dancers, "Please help me?")

3740
02:24:59,996 --> 02:25:03,136
(If I knew my problem, I'd want to fix it quickly.)

3741
02:25:03,136 --> 02:25:04,636
(It's just my lack of ability.)

3742
02:25:04,636 --> 02:25:06,236
(Sighing)

3743
02:25:07,106 --> 02:25:08,406
(I must be the director.)

3744
02:25:08,406 --> 02:25:09,976
(I can never lose this.)

3745
02:25:09,976 --> 02:25:11,036
(I really want it.)

3746
02:25:11,376 --> 02:25:13,046
(The owner of the final work will be...)

3747
02:25:13,046 --> 02:25:15,246
(only one director.)

3748
02:25:15,776 --> 02:25:18,076
(It will now be proven here.)

3749
02:25:18,076 --> 02:25:20,246
(About who is the true director.)
